  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8b94551376ad1124",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS：新一代富有表现力的 AI 语音",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d644870825cdf08",
      "translationZh": "我们最新的音频模型引入了细粒度音频标签，让你能够精准控制和指导 AI 语音，生成富有表现力的音频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec93135287182ced",
      "translationZh": "技术团队成员",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b8eafd6d2b9cb53",
      "translationZh": "首席研究工程师，代表 Gemini 团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "你的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f97973056b19aaca",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS 现已推出，为你带来更出色的 AI 语音质量和控制能力。现在，你可以使用音频标签调整 70 多种语言的发声风格和语速节奏。在 Google AI Studio、Vertex AI 和 Google Vids 中试用它，并请知悉，所有音频均嵌入了 SynthID 水印，以防止虚假信息传播。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "18dabcd998b8b3d4",
      "translationZh": "“Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS”是一款全新的 AI 语音模型，具有更强的可控性、表现力和更高的质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "09c45b282b60b87b",
      "translationZh": "这款模型提升了语音质量，使其听起来比之前的版本更自然。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd734c96b188463f",
      "translationZh": "音频标签让你能够使用自然语言指令控制声音风格、语速和表达方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4a0ab96b1c1b9423",
      "translationZh": "开发者可以使用 Google AI Studio 微调声音并导出设置，以便在使用时保持一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fe0812342fca8485",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS 支持 70+ 种语言，并使用 SynthID 水印技术来识别 AI 生成的音频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92620f4a9d3ae42e",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS 是一款全新的 AI，能让计算机语音听起来更真实。人们可以通过在文本中使用特殊指令，改变 AI 说话的方式。这款 AI 可以使用超过 70 种语言说话，并会在音频中添加隐藏水印。这有助于人们知道音频是由 AI 生成的，而不是真人说的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df43fe55826688f5",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们推出 Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS，这是最新的文本转语音模型，具备更强的可控性、表现力和更高的质量，助力开发者、企业和日常用户构建下一代 AI 语音应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29e65050fc94d8f7",
      "translationZh": "从今天起，3.1 Flash TTS 开始逐步推出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "53828879ae45acbd",
      "translationZh": "面向开发者，通过 Gemini API 和 Google AI Studio 提供预览版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "67717953e5e31f9e",
      "translationZh": "面向企业，在 Vertex AI 上提供预览版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ea2602d221ecda24",
      "translationZh": "面向 Workspace 用户，通过 Google Vids 提供",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "af2878826b75aa64",
      "translationZh": "更出色的语音质量与可控性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59c412bc72baa51f",
      "translationZh": "我们提升了 Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS 的整体语音质量，使其成为我们迄今为止最自然、最具表现力的模型。在 Artificial Analysis TTS 排行榜上，3.1 Flash TTS 获得了令人瞩目的 1,211 分 Elo 评分；该基准汇集了数千次人工盲测中的偏好选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f412aeefdd331bc",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 还将 Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS 列入其“最具吸引力的象限”，因为它在高质量语音生成与低成本之间实现了理想的结合。该模型还凭借原生多说话者对话、对 70+ 种语言的支持，以及通过自然语言实现的精细创作控制，进一步脱颖而出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "334c5777cbc40f93",
      "translationZh": "全新音频标签，让语音生成更具表现力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44f7978cfe7103af",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash TTS 还引入了音频标签——一种直观控制声音风格、语速和表达方式的方法。通过将自然语言指令直接嵌入文本输入，你可以更精细地控制 AI 语音输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3fca6a9821f23aec",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash TTS 让企业能够在 Vertex AI 中使用音频标签，为下一代企业应用赋能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3bef374e073f8886",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash TTS 让你能够使用音频标签，尝试不同的语音表现力、节奏和表达方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b1174597cf9feca1",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash TTS 让你能够集成富有表现力的语音功能，将普通的天气应用变成引人入胜的体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ebfde764675f2308",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash TTS 支持多种音频标签，为同义词寻词应用增添细腻且引人入胜的语音表达。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29609ce90b43ae43",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Google AI Studio 中开始尝试这些音频标签，以及其他开发者体验更新；其中的可配置控件让开发者坐上“导演椅”：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ef5c09e416f4466",
      "translationZh": "场景指导：通过定义环境并提供具体的对话指令来设定场景。这种世界构建背景有助于角色在多轮对话中始终“保持角色设定”，并自然地回应彼此。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "58bffbae198cef7d",
      "translationZh": "说话者级别的细致设置：使用独特的 Audio Profiles 来分配角色，然后指定 Director’s Notes 来切换语速、语调和口音。借助内联标签，说话者可以在这些高层级设置的基础上灵活调整，在句子中途改变表达方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c700950451ac6200",
      "translationZh": "无缝导出：一旦语音表现调整到理想状态，就可以将这些精确参数导出为 Gemini API 代码，确保在不同项目和平台上保持声音的一致性和辨识度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bffd24ca732b8a77",
      "translationZh": "借助这些新配置，开发者可以针对特定场景实现更精准的控制，打造令人难忘的角色和沉浸式音频体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33bf528dda28db9b",
      "translationZh": "前往 Google AI Studio Playground，开始使用高保真语音生成功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ae611ebd37d30e8d",
      "translationZh": "专为全球规模应用而打造",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f88aebb0e4131c10",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS 可在超过 70 种语言中提供高保真语音和更精准的控制。这些核心优化为主要市场带来了先进的风格、节奏和口音控制能力，帮助开发者为全球用户打造本地化、富有表现力的语音体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b159ef09f34f66b",
      "translationZh": "早期参与测试的开发者和企业已经看到了 3.1 Flash TTS 带来的成效，并特别称赞了其出色的可控性和表现力。他们向我们反馈，音频标签让创作控制的精确度达到了新的水平，能够将简单的文本转化为高保真的人声表演。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6131b71f03ea0ef4",
      "translationZh": "使用 SynthID 添加水印",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bc7fc61320808cb",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS 生成的所有音频均带有 SynthID 水印。这种无法察觉的水印直接嵌入音频输出中，使 AI 生成内容能够被可靠地检测出来，从而帮助防范虚假信息。有关我们在安全与责任方面所采取措施的更多信息，请查阅模型卡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在收件箱中接收 Google 的最新消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "完成。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看收件箱，确认你的订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "你也可以通过 . 订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81c0514443d15d43",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon：开启我们的前沿智能新时代",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f32c94e810121bc",
      "translationZh": "观看 Future Vision XPRIZE 获奖预告片《The Gifted》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1dcfa6e64bf1becb",
      "translationZh": "看看 4 位开发者正在用 Gemini 3.8 Flash 打造什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "39afd3b78512f5a1",
      "translationZh": "推出搭载 Live Avatar 的 Gemini 3.8 Live",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c6c3ba8ca3a0a1e",
      "translationZh": "作者：Shuo-yiin Chang 和 CJ Zheng",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
